1
00:00:19,839 --> 00:00:20,280
Hey

2
00:02:43,560 --> 00:02:44,759
Yujiang City

3
00:02:44,759 --> 00:02:47,479
The Black Snake syndicate has held power for years.

4
00:02:47,479 --> 00:02:49,400
The Snake King hides deep in the shadows,

5
00:02:49,400 --> 00:02:51,199
his identity a complete mystery.

6
00:02:51,199 --> 00:02:53,800
Under his command, Wu Xiang and Wang Congjun

7
00:02:53,800 --> 00:02:54,879
are equally matched,

8
00:02:55,400 --> 00:02:57,199
locked in a ruthless covert war.

9
00:02:58,159 --> 00:03:01,319
Who is the real Snake King?

10
00:03:02,199 --> 00:03:04,080
The police have quietly moved into position.

11
00:03:04,319 --> 00:03:07,520
The truth will finally come to light.

12
00:04:01,120 --> 00:04:01,960
You're here.

13
00:04:02,919 --> 00:04:03,800
How are things?

14
00:04:05,520 --> 00:04:07,199
It arrives at the docks tonight.

15
00:04:08,520 --> 00:04:09,759
Then I have to go in person.

16
00:04:10,560 --> 00:04:11,000
Bro,

17
00:04:11,479 --> 00:04:13,520
I'd better bring more guys to protect you.

18
00:04:14,960 --> 00:04:16,199
With you and Ah Tang here,

19
00:04:16,480 --> 00:04:17,800
I couldn't be safer.

20
00:04:23,160 --> 00:04:24,480
Ah Tang, Ah Tang...

21
00:04:24,680 --> 00:04:26,000
Alright, alright.

22
00:04:29,120 --> 00:04:29,879
Who is it?

23
00:04:30,639 --> 00:04:31,560
An undercover cop.

24
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:55,199
All right, that's enough.

25
00:04:55,199 --> 00:04:56,839
There's no need for that.

26
00:05:01,079 --> 00:05:01,839
Cops.

27
00:05:01,839 --> 00:05:03,000
Wang Congjun's men.

28
00:05:06,839 --> 00:05:07,319
Hey.

29
00:05:08,480 --> 00:05:09,639
Listen up, everyone.

30
00:05:10,680 --> 00:05:11,600
Tonight,

31
00:05:12,319 --> 00:05:13,800
an hour earlier,

32
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:16,879
we...

33
00:05:38,120 --> 00:05:39,600
Aren't you an art teacher?

34
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:40,720
What are you doing here?

35
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:42,079
Uh, I...

36
00:05:46,480 --> 00:05:47,319
I asked you a question.

37
00:05:53,879 --> 00:05:54,759
Well...

38
00:05:54,759 --> 00:05:56,160
Qingqing said last time she was here,

39
00:05:56,160 --> 00:05:57,519
painting Mr. Wu's portrait,

40
00:05:57,759 --> 00:05:59,079
she left her art supplies behind.

41
00:05:59,079 --> 00:06:00,920
I... I came to pick them up.

42
00:06:01,120 --> 00:06:02,120
Ms. Yang.

43
00:06:02,120 --> 00:06:02,639
Yes?

44
00:06:02,959 --> 00:06:03,480
Oh.

45
00:06:03,639 --> 00:06:04,759
Her art supplies are over there.

46
00:06:06,519 --> 00:06:06,920
Okay.

47
00:06:07,079 --> 00:06:07,720
Go ahead.

48
00:06:23,920 --> 00:06:24,759
Sorry about that.

49
00:06:49,120 --> 00:06:50,600
Just grab your stuff and go.

50
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:51,399
Huh?

51
00:07:09,279 --> 00:07:09,920
Brother Wu.

52
00:07:09,920 --> 00:07:10,439
Yeah?

53
00:07:10,879 --> 00:07:11,879
Do we need to deal with Ms. Yang?

54
00:07:12,040 --> 00:07:13,279
Come on, are you guys...

55
00:07:13,759 --> 00:07:15,240
...letting Wang Congjun's mess...

56
00:07:16,480 --> 00:07:17,920
...make you totally paranoid?

57
00:07:19,120 --> 00:07:20,920
Tang, get him out of here.

58
00:07:54,639 --> 00:07:55,199
Go on.

59
00:08:00,399 --> 00:08:02,399
Huang Lun is surrounded at Wang Congjun's place.

60
00:08:02,399 --> 00:08:04,079
You two head over there and wait.

61
00:08:05,160 --> 00:08:06,519
Wait there, I'm on my way.

62
00:08:07,240 --> 00:08:07,920
Brother Hao.

63
00:08:08,879 --> 00:08:09,920
Thanks for earlier.

64
00:08:11,560 --> 00:08:12,480
I'm Yang Jingya.

65
00:08:22,439 --> 00:08:23,839
Stay away from the study from now on.

66
00:08:39,120 --> 00:08:40,279
Whoever hurt Brother Wu

67
00:08:40,279 --> 00:08:41,240
has to answer for it today.

68
00:09:24,919 --> 00:09:25,879
Brother Hao.

69
00:09:28,519 --> 00:09:29,440
What's the deal?

70
00:09:29,840 --> 00:09:31,279
Coming to my place all alone,

71
00:09:31,720 --> 00:09:33,120
here to demand an explanation too?

72
00:09:33,120 --> 00:09:33,879
Huh?

73
00:09:36,919 --> 00:09:37,879
Then let me see

74
00:09:38,759 --> 00:09:40,200
if I can get an explanation.

75
00:10:01,279 --> 00:10:02,240
Are you gonna give an explanation?

76
00:10:04,559 --> 00:10:05,039
I will.

77
00:10:05,039 --> 00:10:05,519
Hey.

78
00:10:06,799 --> 00:10:07,759
Should've said so earlier.

79
00:10:10,440 --> 00:10:11,080
Lun.

80
00:10:11,639 --> 00:10:12,480
Come here. Come on.

81
00:10:12,759 --> 00:10:13,799
He'll give an explanation.

82
00:10:33,559 --> 00:10:35,480
Those bastards hit way too hard, Bro.

83
00:10:35,759 --> 00:10:36,759
Listen to me.

84
00:10:37,519 --> 00:10:40,120
If you act on your own and stir up trouble again,

85
00:10:41,240 --> 00:10:42,600
don't expect me to save your ass.

86
00:10:42,600 --> 00:10:43,519
Bro, wasn't I just...

87
00:10:44,120 --> 00:10:46,559
trying to take the load off you and Brother Wu?

88
00:10:47,559 --> 00:10:48,320
Hey, hey, hey.

89
00:10:51,799 --> 00:10:52,440
Thanks, Bro.

90
00:10:52,639 --> 00:10:53,559
Alright, that's enough.

91
00:10:54,639 --> 00:10:55,799
I've got business, so I'm heading out.

92
00:10:56,960 --> 00:10:57,639
You've got business?

93
00:10:58,080 --> 00:10:58,799
Hey, Bro.

94
00:10:59,039 --> 00:10:59,960
Business?

95
00:11:00,120 --> 00:11:01,879
Is Brother Wu calling you for a big job?

96
00:11:05,559 --> 00:11:06,399
I'm telling you,

97
00:11:06,399 --> 00:11:07,679
don't stick your nose where it doesn't belong.

98
00:11:08,039 --> 00:11:08,399
Aw, come on.

99
00:11:09,960 --> 00:11:10,960
Look, Bro.

100
00:11:10,960 --> 00:11:12,320
You're my big bro, right? Aren't you?

101
00:11:12,320 --> 00:11:13,279
Then... then Brother Wu...

102
00:11:13,279 --> 00:11:15,240
is basically my top boss, right?

103
00:11:15,240 --> 00:11:17,080
I've been in Black Snake for over a year,

104
00:11:17,080 --> 00:11:18,919
and I haven't even laid eyes on the big man.

105
00:11:18,919 --> 00:11:21,120
It's embarrassing if word gets out, Bro, isn't it?

106
00:11:21,120 --> 00:11:22,960
Just take me along! I swear I'll do whatever you say.

107
00:11:22,960 --> 00:11:24,440
Whatever you tell me to do, I'll do.

108
00:11:24,440 --> 00:11:25,039
Hey, Bro!

109
00:11:26,000 --> 00:11:26,480
If you...

110
00:11:26,840 --> 00:11:28,480
If you don't take me, you're not driving anywhere!

111
00:11:29,720 --> 00:11:30,639
Let go.

112
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:36,120
Let go!

113
00:11:41,720 --> 00:11:42,919
Shut the door!

114
00:11:58,200 --> 00:11:59,200
I don't care, Bro.

115
00:11:59,200 --> 00:12:00,200
If you won't take me,

116
00:12:00,200 --> 00:12:02,000
I'll go stake out Brother Wu's place.

117
00:12:20,600 --> 00:12:21,559
Stay here.

118
00:12:22,639 --> 00:12:23,519
Come on, Bro, what am I...

119
00:12:23,519 --> 00:12:24,679
...supposed to do waiting here?

120
00:12:24,679 --> 00:12:25,559
I'm definitely going with you.

121
00:12:31,200 --> 00:12:32,240
Sitting in the car...

122
00:12:33,159 --> 00:12:34,000
...is so boring.

123
00:12:35,120 --> 00:12:36,240
Just stay here.

124
00:12:37,120 --> 00:12:38,159
Wait for my word.

125
00:12:39,720 --> 00:12:40,279
Hey!

126
00:13:08,639 --> 00:13:09,279
Just got here?

127
00:13:11,120 --> 00:13:12,000
Had some business to handle.

128
00:13:12,679 --> 00:13:13,120
Where's Brother Wu?

129
00:13:13,879 --> 00:13:14,720
He's been here a while.

130
00:13:15,600 --> 00:13:16,200
Let's go.

131
00:13:16,399 --> 00:13:16,799
Coming.

132
00:13:34,799 --> 00:13:35,480
Brother Wu.

133
00:13:35,480 --> 00:13:36,120
Yeah.

134
00:13:49,159 --> 00:13:49,639
Brother Wu.

135
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:50,639
Looking sharp.

136
00:13:52,480 --> 00:13:53,080
Where's the stuff?

137
00:13:55,279 --> 00:13:55,879
Ah Tang,

138
00:14:03,039 --> 00:14:05,279
it was all smuggled in just like you asked.

139
00:14:05,759 --> 00:14:06,840
In Yujiang right now,

140
00:14:07,120 --> 00:14:08,759
our route is the safest.

141
00:14:09,759 --> 00:14:10,879
When Snake King's people handle things,

142
00:14:11,480 --> 00:14:12,639
I never have to worry.

143
00:14:15,039 --> 00:14:15,600
Brother Wu.

144
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:16,679
Yeah?

145
00:14:16,679 --> 00:14:17,840
It's your birthday today.

146
00:14:18,799 --> 00:14:19,320
This is...

147
00:14:20,120 --> 00:14:20,639
a little tribute for you.

148
00:14:23,320 --> 00:14:24,440
Look at him.

149
00:14:41,440 --> 00:14:42,799
You dare double-cross me?!

150
00:14:42,799 --> 00:14:43,480
Agh!

151
00:14:47,399 --> 00:14:48,840
Don't let a single one get away!

152
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:00,679
Get in.

153
00:15:01,000 --> 00:15:02,080
The car's here. Let's go.

154
00:15:02,200 --> 00:15:03,279
Get in, get in.

155
00:15:03,799 --> 00:15:04,440
Move!

156
00:15:30,679 --> 00:15:31,159
Brother.

157
00:15:31,159 --> 00:15:31,720
Yeah.

158
00:15:31,840 --> 00:15:32,519
Hanging in there?

159
00:15:33,039 --> 00:15:33,919
I'm fine, I'm fine.

160
00:15:35,519 --> 00:15:36,279
Brother,

161
00:15:37,080 --> 00:15:37,960
I was careless.

162
00:15:37,960 --> 00:15:40,399
Come on, we're brothers. Don't say that.

163
00:15:41,080 --> 00:15:43,200
After working with Baldy for so many years,

164
00:15:43,200 --> 00:15:44,759
he dared to turn on us,

165
00:15:44,759 --> 00:15:46,679
showing no respect to Snake King.

166
00:15:47,000 --> 00:15:48,600
Who could be behind him?

167
00:15:49,519 --> 00:15:51,919
Good thing Chenghao

168
00:15:51,919 --> 00:15:53,440
parked the car right there.

169
00:15:53,559 --> 00:15:54,159
Yeah.

170
00:15:54,519 --> 00:15:56,039
Brother Hao thought of everything.

171
00:15:57,559 --> 00:15:58,799
Did anyone tell you to speak?

172
00:15:59,360 --> 00:15:59,960
Hm.

173
00:16:02,639 --> 00:16:03,679
New guy?

174
00:16:04,799 --> 00:16:05,399
Brother.

175
00:16:05,399 --> 00:16:06,000
Yeah.

176
00:16:06,519 --> 00:16:07,759
Huang Lun's been with me for almost a year.

177
00:16:07,759 --> 00:16:08,799
He's pretty sharp.

178
00:16:11,480 --> 00:16:12,360
Brother Wu.

179
00:16:13,200 --> 00:16:13,919
Brother Tang.

180
00:16:14,240 --> 00:16:15,200
Kid,

181
00:16:15,960 --> 00:16:17,639
you drive pretty well.

182
00:16:17,720 --> 00:16:18,440
It's alright.

183
00:16:20,360 --> 00:16:20,799
Brother.

184
00:16:20,799 --> 00:16:21,399
Yeah?

185
00:16:21,399 --> 00:16:22,639
The goods are still at the dock.

186
00:16:22,639 --> 00:16:23,639
Should we send people over?

187
00:16:23,639 --> 00:16:24,759
Forget it, forget it.

188
00:16:25,559 --> 00:16:26,759
Just take me back first.

189
00:16:29,200 --> 00:16:30,120
Keep it steady.

190
00:16:31,240 --> 00:16:31,679
Got it.

191
00:16:31,960 --> 00:16:32,840
Step on it.

192
00:16:50,559 --> 00:16:52,000
Don't forget your mission:

193
00:16:52,000 --> 00:16:53,399
to catch the Snake King.

194
00:16:57,039 --> 00:16:58,759
Just who is the Snake King?

195
00:17:07,079 --> 00:17:07,559
Lao Wu.

196
00:17:07,559 --> 00:17:07,839
Yeah.

197
00:17:07,839 --> 00:17:08,519
It's nothing too serious.

198
00:17:08,519 --> 00:17:08,920
Right.

199
00:17:09,079 --> 00:17:10,279
Keep an eye on the wound for the next couple of days

200
00:17:10,519 --> 00:17:11,359
to prevent post-op infection.

201
00:17:11,960 --> 00:17:12,480
And another thing,

202
00:17:13,400 --> 00:17:14,640
tobacco, alcohol, and greasy meat—

203
00:17:15,000 --> 00:17:15,680
stay away from them.

204
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:16,720
Thanks for coming out.

205
00:17:16,920 --> 00:17:17,359
No trouble at all.

206
00:17:17,640 --> 00:17:18,240
I'll take off now.

207
00:17:18,799 --> 00:17:19,279
Ah Tang,

208
00:17:19,519 --> 00:17:20,079
walk him out.

209
00:17:20,079 --> 00:17:20,559
Sure.

210
00:17:20,839 --> 00:17:21,279
This way.

211
00:17:25,200 --> 00:17:26,000
Get me a cigarette.

212
00:17:28,559 --> 00:17:29,720
How about I pour you a drink too?

213
00:17:30,240 --> 00:17:31,359
The doc said it's nothing serious.

214
00:17:31,359 --> 00:17:32,279
Still acting tough.

215
00:17:32,680 --> 00:17:33,799
If that wound were any deeper,

216
00:17:33,799 --> 00:17:35,279
you wouldn't be here to see me and our daughter.

217
00:17:36,200 --> 00:17:36,960
I'm tough to kill.

218
00:17:37,920 --> 00:17:39,599
You're still in the mood to joke?

219
00:17:40,359 --> 00:17:42,119
We've only had a few peaceful years.

220
00:17:43,079 --> 00:17:44,119
Why did this happen again?

221
00:17:47,160 --> 00:17:48,319
This is the last time.

222
00:17:48,319 --> 00:17:49,000
Really?

223
00:17:49,240 --> 00:17:51,079
Once I wrap this business up,

224
00:17:51,079 --> 00:17:53,480
I'll take the two of you abroad.

225
00:17:53,480 --> 00:17:55,000
I'm a man of my word.

226
00:17:55,000 --> 00:17:56,079
You say that every time.

227
00:17:57,839 --> 00:17:59,119
Chenghao is here.

228
00:18:05,240 --> 00:18:05,720
Chenghao.

229
00:18:05,720 --> 00:18:06,119
Yeah, Sister-in-law?

230
00:18:06,279 --> 00:18:06,960
Thank you.

231
00:18:06,960 --> 00:18:07,599
Oh, Sister-in-law,

232
00:18:07,599 --> 00:18:08,720
don't say that.

233
00:18:08,720 --> 00:18:09,759
If it weren't for Brother Wu,

234
00:18:09,759 --> 00:18:10,839
none of us would be where we are today.

235
00:18:14,960 --> 00:18:15,799
Were you driving?

236
00:18:16,839 --> 00:18:17,240
Right.

237
00:18:17,559 --> 00:18:17,960
Yes.

238
00:18:20,119 --> 00:18:20,839
Stay for dinner.

239
00:18:21,920 --> 00:18:22,519
I'll set it up.

240
00:18:22,519 --> 00:18:23,000
Yeah.

241
00:18:23,400 --> 00:18:24,640
Don't trouble yourself, Sister-in-law.

242
00:18:24,640 --> 00:18:26,039
We can just grab a quick bite.

243
00:18:26,279 --> 00:18:27,119
Come on.

244
00:18:27,680 --> 00:18:28,960
Just stay.

245
00:18:29,640 --> 00:18:31,119
We're all family here.

246
00:18:32,720 --> 00:18:33,720
Eat some extra meat for me.

247
00:18:34,200 --> 00:18:34,559
All right.

248
00:18:35,359 --> 00:18:36,079
Come on, Huang Lun.

249
00:18:36,400 --> 00:18:36,960
Thanks, Brother Wu.

250
00:18:38,319 --> 00:18:39,000
Thanks, Brother Wu.

251
00:18:39,319 --> 00:18:39,839
Yeah.

252
00:18:41,920 --> 00:18:42,440
Come on, everyone.

253
00:18:42,440 --> 00:18:43,279
Help yourselves.

254
00:18:43,279 --> 00:18:44,960
I made all these dishes myself today.

255
00:18:45,759 --> 00:18:47,039
Thank you, Sister-in-law. Thanks a lot.

256
00:18:48,160 --> 00:18:48,839
Xiaoya.

257
00:18:48,839 --> 00:18:49,240
Yes?

258
00:18:49,480 --> 00:18:51,079
Things have been so hectic at home lately.

259
00:18:51,319 --> 00:18:52,720
Thanks for looking after Qingqing.

260
00:18:53,680 --> 00:18:55,240
Her dad and I spoiled her rotten.

261
00:18:55,960 --> 00:18:56,839
She's quite a handful.

262
00:18:57,079 --> 00:18:58,079
Not at all.

263
00:18:58,519 --> 00:19:00,079
Qingqing is very sweet, isn't she?

264
00:19:00,400 --> 00:19:02,920
Plus, she learns fast and is so smart.

265
00:19:03,319 --> 00:19:04,200
That's only because it's you.

266
00:19:04,200 --> 00:19:06,680
With anyone else, she wouldn't be this good.

267
00:19:09,319 --> 00:19:09,880
Chenghao.

268
00:19:09,960 --> 00:19:10,400
Yeah?

269
00:19:10,759 --> 00:19:12,039
What do you think of Xiaoya?

270
00:19:17,359 --> 00:19:18,039
She's great.

271
00:19:19,240 --> 00:19:19,960
What about you, Xiaoya?

272
00:19:21,319 --> 00:19:22,480
I think he's great too.

273
00:19:22,480 --> 00:19:23,839
I think you two are great together.

274
00:19:23,839 --> 00:19:25,759
A man should make the first move, you know.

275
00:19:31,519 --> 00:19:32,200
Sister-in-law,

276
00:19:32,759 --> 00:19:34,880
I've been so busy I barely have time to sleep.

277
00:19:34,880 --> 00:19:36,200
If you really like someone,

278
00:19:36,200 --> 00:19:37,640
nothing can get in the way.

279
00:19:38,079 --> 00:19:40,240
If Brother Wu hadn't pursued me back then,

280
00:19:40,240 --> 00:19:41,319
how could our big family

281
00:19:41,319 --> 00:19:42,319
be eating together like this, right?

282
00:19:42,319 --> 00:19:44,279
How could I possibly compare to Brother Wu?

283
00:20:00,839 --> 00:20:01,240
Boss,

284
00:20:02,400 --> 00:20:03,279
we've searched everywhere for that shipment,

285
00:20:03,279 --> 00:20:04,519
but it's vanished into thin air.

286
00:20:04,519 --> 00:20:05,799
It's gotta be Wang Congjun again.

287
00:20:06,000 --> 00:20:06,559
Should I take some guys and—

288
00:20:06,559 --> 00:20:07,319
Hey, no, no.

289
00:20:07,599 --> 00:20:08,119
No need.

290
00:20:09,200 --> 00:20:10,000
In a few days,

291
00:20:10,160 --> 00:20:11,519
I'll pay him a visit myself.

292
00:20:12,279 --> 00:20:14,119
Wang Congjun isn't our priority right now.

293
00:20:14,960 --> 00:20:15,559
Remember?

294
00:20:15,559 --> 00:20:17,160
Yesterday, I specifically said

295
00:20:17,279 --> 00:20:19,240
we'd move an hour early.

296
00:20:20,079 --> 00:20:20,960
You mean...

297
00:20:21,599 --> 00:20:23,240
That guy Chenghao brought along—

298
00:20:23,240 --> 00:20:24,200
he's a new face.

299
00:20:25,200 --> 00:20:26,680
You think that blond kid is suspicious, Boss?

300
00:20:29,000 --> 00:20:30,440
How did he and Chenghao meet?

301
00:20:30,440 --> 00:20:32,200
Word is, debt collectors chased him onto Chenghao's turf,

302
00:20:32,200 --> 00:20:33,359
and Chenghao protected him.

303
00:20:33,799 --> 00:20:34,920
If you think he's dirty, Boss, I'll go—

304
00:20:34,920 --> 00:20:35,519
No, no, no.

305
00:20:35,720 --> 00:20:37,160
He's Chenghao's guy, after all.

306
00:20:37,160 --> 00:20:38,039
Let's just wait and see.

307
00:20:50,200 --> 00:20:50,920
A birthday gift.

308
00:20:50,920 --> 00:20:52,400
Think carefully about what I said.

309
00:20:53,200 --> 00:20:54,039
Thanks, Sister-in-law.

310
00:20:56,000 --> 00:20:56,480
No, Sister-in-law...

311
00:20:57,160 --> 00:20:58,359
This gift is too valuable. I can can't take this.

312
00:20:58,359 --> 00:20:59,640
Just take it if I tell you to.

313
00:20:59,640 --> 00:21:00,759
How about this, Sister-in-law:

314
00:21:00,880 --> 00:21:02,359
did Qingqing braid this bracelet for you?

315
00:21:02,359 --> 00:21:03,640
Have her braid another one for me,

316
00:21:03,640 --> 00:21:04,319
all right?

317
00:21:04,319 --> 00:21:05,279
You want this?

318
00:21:05,279 --> 00:21:06,079
That won't do.

319
00:21:06,519 --> 00:21:07,400
If Qingqing makes one for you,

320
00:21:07,400 --> 00:21:08,400
I'll get jealous.

321
00:21:08,400 --> 00:21:09,559
So just take this one,

322
00:21:09,559 --> 00:21:10,079
okay?

323
00:21:10,720 --> 00:21:11,240
Thank you, Sister-in-law.

324
00:21:11,440 --> 00:21:12,319
Stop fooling around, you two.

325
00:21:12,559 --> 00:21:13,559
Xiaoya, come here for a second.

326
00:21:15,839 --> 00:21:16,319
Sister-in-law.

327
00:21:16,920 --> 00:21:17,799
It's getting late.

328
00:21:18,200 --> 00:21:19,240
Let Chenghao see you home.

329
00:21:21,359 --> 00:21:22,200
That's all right, Sister-in-law.

330
00:21:22,200 --> 00:21:23,160
I can head back on my own.

331
00:21:23,160 --> 00:21:23,559
Come on.

332
00:21:24,480 --> 00:21:26,359
I'll feel better if he takes you.

333
00:21:44,279 --> 00:21:45,400
Sister Xue is pretty warm, huh?

334
00:21:46,680 --> 00:21:47,319
Oh.

335
00:21:47,319 --> 00:21:48,039
Yeah.

336
00:21:49,240 --> 00:21:50,519
Sister Xue has always

337
00:21:51,200 --> 00:21:52,160
loved fussing over everyone.

338
00:21:52,839 --> 00:21:54,039
I can tell.

339
00:21:54,359 --> 00:21:56,000
She and Qingqing both really like you.

340
00:21:58,640 --> 00:22:00,400
Qingqing mentions Uncle Tang to me all the time.

341
00:22:04,359 --> 00:22:06,079
I didn't think you knew how to smile.

342
00:22:28,599 --> 00:22:29,200
Sit tight.

343
00:23:02,559 --> 00:23:03,480
Stay in the car, don't move.

344
00:23:03,480 --> 00:23:04,279
Brother Hao, don't go!

345
00:23:04,279 --> 00:23:05,000
Stay put.

346
00:23:05,599 --> 00:23:06,079
Take this.

347
00:23:08,359 --> 00:23:09,279
Be careful.

348
00:23:26,680 --> 00:23:27,400
Where's the phone?

349
00:23:27,400 --> 00:23:28,200
The phone.

350
00:23:40,400 --> 00:23:41,640
You're bleeding.

351
00:23:50,319 --> 00:23:51,400
Don't get it on your pants.

352
00:23:51,400 --> 00:23:52,559
I'm fine.

353
00:23:53,480 --> 00:23:54,759
Are you sure you don't need to go to the hospital?

354
00:23:56,079 --> 00:23:56,880
I'm used to it.

355
00:23:59,640 --> 00:24:01,119
Who were those guys just now?

356
00:24:05,880 --> 00:24:07,119
Did that scare you?

357
00:24:09,279 --> 00:24:10,519
Yeah, I was pretty scared.

358
00:24:12,240 --> 00:24:13,039
Why?

359
00:24:13,920 --> 00:24:14,839
Afraid I couldn't handle it?

360
00:24:16,519 --> 00:24:17,319
No.

361
00:24:19,079 --> 00:24:20,680
It was when you yelled at me as you got out of the car.

362
00:24:20,680 --> 00:24:21,920
That really scared me.

363
00:24:27,240 --> 00:24:28,160
I'm sorry about that.

364
00:24:29,079 --> 00:24:29,759
It's okay.

365
00:24:32,119 --> 00:24:33,680
Why are they trying to kill you?

366
00:24:36,920 --> 00:24:39,240
Isn't that how it is in our line of work?

367
00:24:40,839 --> 00:24:42,400
Still, thinking back, I was pretty shaken up too.

368
00:24:44,119 --> 00:24:45,839
If anything had happened to you,

369
00:24:46,240 --> 00:24:47,720
how would I face your family?

370
00:24:53,559 --> 00:24:54,839
I don't have any family.

371
00:24:57,960 --> 00:24:59,720
I grew up in an orphanage.

372
00:25:02,640 --> 00:25:03,200
Oh.

373
00:25:10,079 --> 00:25:11,880
Why didn't you do what everyone else does,

374
00:25:11,880 --> 00:25:13,440
and tell me you're sorry?

375
00:25:14,640 --> 00:25:15,519
Why would I?

376
00:25:17,200 --> 00:25:18,200
Pity you?

377
00:25:19,240 --> 00:25:20,279
What's wrong with being an orphan?

378
00:25:20,640 --> 00:25:22,119
Are orphans any different?

379
00:25:27,079 --> 00:25:29,240
That's the first time I've heard anyone say that.

380
00:25:31,519 --> 00:25:33,920
We don't get to choose where we come from,

381
00:25:35,960 --> 00:25:37,960
but we have the right to choose how we live.

382
00:25:41,359 --> 00:25:42,759
As long as you're living happily,

383
00:25:43,519 --> 00:25:45,079
you don't need anyone's pity.

384
00:25:52,640 --> 00:25:54,079
I like...

385
00:26:02,960 --> 00:26:03,839
that line of yours.

386
00:26:08,200 --> 00:26:09,400
I like it too.

387
00:26:14,400 --> 00:26:15,119
Let's go.

388
00:26:27,680 --> 00:26:29,599
You still haven't told me your name.

389
00:26:37,400 --> 00:26:38,319
Tang Chenghao.

390
00:26:46,279 --> 00:26:47,519
Have some candy, it won't hurt anymore.

391
00:27:05,680 --> 00:27:06,240
Mom,

392
00:27:06,759 --> 00:27:07,359
Yeah?

393
00:27:08,119 --> 00:27:09,680
You sprained your back, so just lie down.

394
00:27:10,119 --> 00:27:11,119
No need to come out.

395
00:27:11,599 --> 00:27:12,519
I'm almost there.

396
00:27:12,519 --> 00:27:13,440
Don't worry.

397
00:27:15,079 --> 00:27:15,519
Wait...

398
00:27:17,000 --> 00:27:18,079
Why is the road blocked?

399
00:27:20,559 --> 00:27:21,839
Hey, Lao Wu.

400
00:27:22,640 --> 00:27:24,359
The main road is blocked.

401
00:27:24,359 --> 00:27:26,160
I might get home late.

402
00:27:26,160 --> 00:27:27,440
I have to take a detour through the back roads.

403
00:27:27,440 --> 00:27:28,359
Well, if you can't,

404
00:27:28,359 --> 00:27:30,200
just stay at Mom's for the night.

405
00:27:30,200 --> 00:27:31,240
Stay safe.

406
00:27:31,240 --> 00:27:31,599
Yeah.

407
00:27:32,039 --> 00:27:33,440
Go to sleep first. Don't wait up for me.

408
00:27:33,440 --> 00:27:33,920
Okay.

409
00:27:33,920 --> 00:27:34,400
Mm-hmm.

410
00:27:49,079 --> 00:27:49,480
Hey.

411
00:28:51,400 --> 00:28:51,799
Hello?

412
00:28:52,240 --> 00:28:53,480
Mom, it's me.

413
00:28:53,480 --> 00:28:54,599
Has Xiaoxue arrived?

414
00:28:55,359 --> 00:28:57,599
No. Did something happen?

415
00:28:58,119 --> 00:28:58,920
Oh, no, no, no.

416
00:28:59,279 --> 00:29:01,480
She told me it was foggy today,

417
00:29:01,480 --> 00:29:02,359
so she's driving slowly.

418
00:29:02,359 --> 00:29:03,319
Don't worry.

419
00:29:04,119 --> 00:29:05,039
Yeah, okay.

420
00:29:09,519 --> 00:29:11,400
Xiaoxue left two hours ago,

421
00:29:11,400 --> 00:29:12,759
but she hasn't reached Grandma's yet.

422
00:29:12,759 --> 00:29:13,640
Tell the boys...

423
00:29:13,640 --> 00:29:15,480
to check every route to Grandma's house.

424
00:29:15,480 --> 00:29:16,079
Go find her, now!

425
00:29:16,079 --> 00:29:16,559
Yes, sir!

426
00:29:17,039 --> 00:29:18,680
Move, move, move! I'll drive!

427
00:29:20,000 --> 00:29:20,400
Hurry up! Hurry!

428
00:29:20,400 --> 00:29:21,160
Move faster!

429
00:29:24,160 --> 00:29:25,599
Both victims were female,

430
00:29:25,599 --> 00:29:27,480
both over 170 centimeters tall,

431
00:29:27,480 --> 00:29:29,079
slender and attractive.

432
00:29:29,079 --> 00:29:30,359
The first victim, Zeng Xiaoli...

433
00:29:31,000 --> 00:29:32,720
was killed three months ago,

434
00:29:32,720 --> 00:29:34,599
around 11:00 p.m. on December 7th.

435
00:29:34,759 --> 00:29:35,759
The last place she was seen...

436
00:29:35,759 --> 00:29:36,799
was near People's Park.

437
00:29:36,799 --> 00:29:37,519
Three days later,

438
00:29:37,519 --> 00:29:39,799
her lower limbs were found near the highway.

439
00:29:39,799 --> 00:29:41,079
This is remarkably similar...

440
00:29:41,079 --> 00:29:42,759
to the second victim, Yu Lan's case.

441
00:29:42,759 --> 00:29:43,519
Unfortunately,

442
00:29:43,519 --> 00:29:45,559
we only found the victims' lower limbs,

443
00:29:45,559 --> 00:29:46,839
and couldn't find the primary crime scene.

444
00:29:47,519 --> 00:29:49,079
Captain Liao, we found another one!

445
00:29:52,200 --> 00:29:53,440
As for their social circles,

446
00:29:53,440 --> 00:29:54,720
no connection has been found between them.

447
00:29:54,720 --> 00:29:56,319
However, they share one thing in common:

448
00:29:56,319 --> 00:29:57,920
both have a tattoo on their ankle.

449
00:30:02,759 --> 00:30:03,720
Who are you?!

450
00:30:03,960 --> 00:30:05,119
Let me go!

451
00:30:05,640 --> 00:30:07,680
Help!

452
00:30:08,079 --> 00:30:09,200
These legs of yours...

453
00:30:10,400 --> 00:30:11,319
on your body...

454
00:30:12,160 --> 00:30:13,079
don't look good.
